{"unit":141,"section":6,"cefr":"B1","objective":"recognize borrowed words in Hebrew","skill":"Loanwords","heading":"Loanwords in Hebrew","phrases":[{"he":"יאללה, בוא נלך!","en":"Come on, let's go!","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"יאללה","h":["come on","let's go"]},{"w":"בוא","h":["come","let's"]},{"w":"נלך","h":["let's go","we'll go"]}]},{"he":"הטלפון שלי לא עובד.","en":"My telephone isn't working.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"הטלפון","h":["the telephone","the phone"]},{"w":"שלי","h":["my","mine"]},{"w":"לא","h":["not","isn't"]},{"w":"עובד","h":["working","works"]}]},{"he":"איזה בלגן יש פה!","en":"What a mess there is here!","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"איזה","h":["what a","which"]},{"w":"בלגן","h":["mess","chaos"]},{"w":"יש","h":["there is","there are"]},{"w":"פה","h":["here"]}]},{"he":"הכול סבבה, חביבי.","en":"Everything is cool, dear.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"הכול","h":["everything","all"]},{"w":"סבבה","h":["cool","alright","fine"]},{"w":"חביבי","h":["dear","my dear"]}]},{"he":"הביורוקרטיה פה מטורפת.","en":"The bureaucracy here is crazy.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"הביורוקרטיה","h":["the bureaucracy"]},{"w":"פה","h":["here"]},{"w":"מטורפת","h":["crazy","insane"]}]}],"sentences":[{"he":"יאללה!","en":"Come on!","alt":["Let's go!"],"t":"t"},{"he":"סבבה, אני בא.","en":"Cool, I'm coming.","alt":["Alright, I'm coming."],"t":"t"},{"he":"חביבי, מה שלומך?","en":"Dear, how are you?","alt":["My dear, how are you?"],"t":"l"},{"he":"איזה בלגן!","en":"What a mess!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הטלפון מצלצל.","en":"The telephone is ringing.","alt":["The phone is ringing."],"t":"t"},{"he":"זה פלוס גדול.","en":"That's a big plus.","alt":["It's a big plus."],"t":"l"},{"he":"אני אוהב דיסקוטק.","en":"I love nightclubs.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הביורוקרטיה קשה.","en":"The bureaucracy is hard.","alt":["The bureaucracy is difficult."],"t":"l"},{"he":"יאללה, בוא נלך!","en":"Come on, let's go!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הכול סבבה אצלך?","en":"Is everything cool with you?","alt":["Is everything alright with you?"],"t":"t"},{"he":"יש לי טלפון חדש.","en":"I have a new telephone.","alt":["I have a new phone."],"t":"l"},{"he":"הבלגן בחדר שלו נורא.","en":"The mess in his room is terrible.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"היא הלכה לדיסקוטק.","en":"She went to a nightclub.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אין פה ביורוקרטיה.","en":"There is no bureaucracy here.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"חביבי, אתה רוצה קפה?","en":"Dear, do you want coffee?","alt":["My dear, do you want coffee?"],"t":"t"},{"he":"זה לא סבבה בכלל.","en":"That's not cool at all.","alt":["It's not alright at all."],"t":"t"},{"he":"הטלפון שלה תמיד מצלצל.","en":"Her phone is always ringing.","alt":["Her telephone always rings."],"t":"l"},{"he":"יאללה, אנחנו מאחרים!","en":"Come on, we're late!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הדיסקוטק סגור היום.","en":"The nightclub is closed today.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"יש פלוס ומינוס בכל דבר.","en":"There is a plus and a minus in everything.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הבלגן הזה לא נורמלי.","en":"This mess is not normal.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הם אמרו יאללה ויצאו.","en":"They said come on and left.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"מספר הטלפון שלי השתנה.","en":"My telephone number changed.","alt":["My phone number changed."],"t":"t"},{"he":"סבבה, אני מסכים איתך.","en":"Cool, I agree with you.","alt":["Alright, I agree with you."],"t":"t"},{"he":"הביורוקרטיה בארץ מעצבנת.","en":"The bureaucracy in the country is annoying.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אני שונא את הביורוקרטיה.","en":"I hate the bureaucracy.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הוא קרא לי חביבי וחייך.","en":"He called me dear and smiled.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הדיסקוטק פתוח עד הבוקר.","en":"The nightclub is open until the morning.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"בלי טלפון אני לא יכול לחיות.","en":"Without a phone I can't live.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"איזה בלגן עשית בדירה!","en":"What a mess you made in the apartment!","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"יאללה חביבי, זה לא נורא.","en":"Come on dear, it's not terrible.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הם רוקדים בדיסקוטק כל לילה.","en":"They dance at the nightclub every night.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הביורוקרטיה הישראלית ידועה בעולם.","en":"Israeli bureaucracy is known in the world.","alt":["The Israeli bureaucracy is world-famous."],"t":"t"},{"he":"סבבה, אני אטפל בבלגן הזה.","en":"Cool, I'll take care of this mess.","alt":["Alright, I'll handle this mess."],"t":"t"},{"he":"חביבי, תן לי את הטלפון שלך.","en":"Dear, give me your phone.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"יש לו הרבה פלוסים בעבודה הזאת.","en":"He has many pluses in this job.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"יאללה, אנחנו צריכים לסיים את הבלגן.","en":"Come on, we need to finish the mess.","alt":["Come on, we need to sort out the mess."],"t":"l"},{"he":"הם הזמינו טלפון חדש דרך האינטרנט.","en":"They ordered a new phone through the internet.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הדיסקוטק היה מלא אנשים אתמול בלילה.","en":"The nightclub was full of people last night.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"בלי ביורוקרטיה, החיים היו יותר פשוטים.","en":"Without bureaucracy, life would be simpler.","alt":[],"t":"t"}],"hints":{"יאללה":"come on / let's go","בוא":"come / let's","נלך":"let's go / we'll go","הטלפון":"the telephone / the phone","שלי":"my / mine","לא":"not / no / don't","עובד":"working / works","איזה":"what a / which","בלגן":"mess / chaos","יש":"there is / there are / have","פה":"here","הכול":"everything / all","סבבה":"cool / alright / fine","חביבי":"dear / my dear","הביורוקרטיה":"the bureaucracy","מטורפת":"crazy / insane","אני":"I / I am","בא":"coming","מה":"what","שלומך":"how are you","מצלצל":"ringing","זה":"this / that / it","פלוס":"plus","גדול":"big / large","אוהב":"love / like","דיסקוטק":"nightclub","קשה":"hard / difficult","אצלך":"with you / at your place","לי":"to me / for me","טלפון":"telephone / phone","חדש":"new","הבלגן":"the mess","בחדר":"in the room","שלו":"his","נורא":"terrible / awful","היא":"she","הלכה":"went","אין":"there is no / there are no","אתה":"you (m.)","רוצה":"want / wants","קפה":"coffee","בכלל":"at all","שלה":"her / hers","תמיד":"always","אנחנו":"we","מאחרים":"late / running late","הדיסקוטק":"the nightclub","סגור":"closed","היום":"today","ומינוס":"and minus","בכל":"in every / in all","דבר":"thing","הזה":"this (m.)","נורמלי":"normal","הם":"they","אמרו":"said","ויצאו":"and left","מספר":"number","השתנה":"changed","מסכים":"agree","איתך":"with you","בארץ":"in the country","מעצבנת":"annoying","שונא":"hate / hates","את":"(acc.)","הוא":"he","קרא":"called","וחייך":"and smiled","פתוח":"open","עד":"until","הבוקר":"the morning","בלי":"without","יכול":"can / able","לחיות":"to live","עשית":"you made / you did","בדירה":"in the apartment","רוקדים":"dance / dancing","כל":"every / all","לילה":"night","הישראלית":"the Israeli (f.)","ידועה":"known / famous","בעולם":"in the world","אטפל":"I'll take care / I'll handle","בבלגן":"in the mess","תן":"give","שלך":"your / yours","לו":"to him / he has","הרבה":"many / a lot","פלוסים":"pluses","בעבודה":"in the job / at work","הזאת":"this (f.)","צריכים":"need / must","לסיים":"to finish","הזמינו":"ordered / invited","דרך":"through / via","האינטרנט":"the internet","היה":"was","מלא":"full","אנשים":"people","אתמול":"yesterday","בלילה":"at night","ביורוקרטיה":"bureaucracy","החיים":"life / the life","היו":"were / would be","יותר":"more","פשוטים":"simple","לו":"to him / he has"},"words":[{"he":"יאללה","en":"come on","alt":["let's go"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"yalla"},{"he":"חביבי","en":"dear","alt":["my dear"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"khabibi"},{"he":"סבבה","en":"cool","alt":["alright","fine"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"sababa"},{"he":"בלגן","en":"mess","alt":["chaos"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"balagan"},{"he":"טלפון","en":"telephone","alt":["phone"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"telefon"},{"he":"ביורוקרטיה","en":"bureaucracy","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"biurokratyah"},{"he":"דיסקוטק","en":"nightclub","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"diskotek"},{"he":"פלוס","en":"plus","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"plus"},{"he":"הביורוקרטיה","en":"the bureaucracy","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"habiurokratyah"},{"he":"הטלפון","en":"the telephone","alt":["the phone"],"from":"skill","tr":"hatelefon"},{"he":"הדיסקוטק","en":"the nightclub","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"hadiskotek"},{"he":"פלוסים","en":"pluses","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"plusim"},{"he":"מצלצל","en":"ringing","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"metzaltzel"},{"he":"נורמלי","en":"normal","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"normali"},{"he":"מאחרים","en":"late","alt":["running late"],"from":"skill","tr":"me'akhrim"},{"he":"הכול","en":"everything","alt":["all"],"from":"phrase","tr":"hakol"},{"he":"מטורפת","en":"crazy","alt":["insane"],"from":"phrase","tr":"meturfefet"},{"he":"נלך","en":"let's go","alt":["we'll go"],"from":"phrase","tr":"nelekh"},{"he":"האינטרנט","en":"the internet","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"ha'internet"},{"he":"ומינוס","en":"and minus","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"uminus"}],"lexemes":["יאללה","חביבי","סבבה","בלגן","טלפון","ביורוקרטיה","דיסקוטק","פלוס","הטלפון","הביורוקרטיה","הדיסקוטק","הבלגן","פלוסים","מצלצל","נורמלי","מטורפת","מאחרים","האינטרנט"],"tips":"## Loanwords in Hebrew\n\nHebrew has borrowed words from many languages throughout its history:\n\n### From Arabic\n- **יאללה** (yalla) — \"come on, let's go\" — perhaps the most common loanword in Israeli slang\n- **חביבי** (khabibi) — \"dear, my dear\" — a term of endearment\n- **סבבה** (sababa) — \"cool, great, alright\" — from Arabic صبابة\n\n### From Russian\n- **בלגן** (balagan) — \"mess, chaos\" — from Russian балаган\n\n### From European Languages\n- **טלפון** (telefon) — \"telephone\" — from Greek/English\n- **ביורוקרטיה** (biurokratyah) — \"bureaucracy\" — from French\n- **דיסקוטק** (diskotek) — \"nightclub\" — from French discothèque\n- **פלוס** (plus) — \"plus\" — from Latin\n- **נורמלי** (normali) — \"normal\" — from European languages\n\n### How Hebrew Adapts Loanwords\nBorrowed words follow Hebrew grammar rules:\n- They receive Hebrew plurals: טלפון → טלפונים, פלוס → פלוסים\n- They take the definite article ה: הטלפון, הדיסקוטק\n- Some become Hebrew verbs: טלפן (to phone), גוגל → גיגל (to google)\n\n### Other Common Sources\n- **Yiddish**: שלימזל (shlimazel — unlucky person), נודניק (nudnik — pest)\n- **Turkish**: דולמה (dolma), קיוסק (kiosk)\n- **Aramaic**: Many religious and legal terms"}
